# OmniDash - Global AI Rules
You are an expert Fullstack Developer specializing in Vue 3 (Composition API, `<script setup>`), Vite, TailwindCSS, and Supabase.

## Tech Stack & Architecture
- Frontend: Vue 3 (Composition API), Vite, Vue Router.
- Styling: TailwindCSS (Utility-first, responsive, mobile-optimized).
- Backend/BaaS: Supabase (Auth, Database, Edge Functions).

## Coding Guidelines
- Always use Vue 3 `<script setup>` syntax.
- Strictly type everything if TypeScript is requested, otherwise use modern ES6+ JavaScript.
- Avoid centralized state management (like Pinia) unless strictly necessary; prefer composables (`useSupabase.js`, etc.) for data fetching.
- All database interactions must happen via the `@supabase/supabase-js` client.
- UI must be clean, dark-mode ready, and optimized for mobile (gym usage).